# Measure weapon fire rates, projectile speeds, and bullet splat lifetime
# against unmodified GTADOS/GTA8.EXE on the `shooting` overlay (`150000` cycles).
# Boots with `suckmyrocket` character name for all 4 weapons (99 rounds) + armour/key.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap delete 60
+300 tap backspace 50
+120 tap backspace 50
+120 tap backspace 50
+120 tap backspace 50
+120 tap backspace 50
+120 tap backspace 50
+120 tap backspace 50
+120 tap backspace 50
+120 tap s 50
+120 tap u 50
+120 tap c 50
+120 tap k 50
+120 tap m 50
+120 tap y 50
+120 tap r 50
+120 tap o 50
+120 tap c 50
+120 tap k 50
+120 tap e 50
+120 tap t 50
+150 tap enter 80
+500 tap enter 80
+1200 tap enter 80

20000 shot setup_start

# 1. Fist punch (held continuous)
20200 down lctrl
+0 burst punch 110 0
+1650 up lctrl
+200 shot after_punch

# 2. Pistol single shot (bullet flight speed + wall splat lifetime)
+150 tap x 60
+300 shot pistol_ready
+100 burst p_single 60 0
+40 tap lctrl 45

# 3. Pistol continuous fire rate
23600 down lctrl
+0 burst p_auto 160 0
+2350 up lctrl
+200 shot after_p_auto

# 4. Machine gun continuous fire rate + shots/ammo-unit
26300 tap x 60
+300 shot mg_ready
+100 down lctrl
+0 burst mg 130 0
+1950 up lctrl
+200 shot after_mg

# 5. Rocket launcher continuous fire rate + flight speed
29000 tap x 60
+300 shot rocket_ready
+100 down lctrl
+0 burst rocket 180 0
+2650 up lctrl
+400 shot after_rocket

# 6. Flamethrower: turn ~180 deg west down open corridor, single puff + continuous
32600 tap x 60
+300 down left
+512 up left
+150 shot flame_west
+100 burst fl_single 75 0
+40 tap lctrl 45

34850 down lctrl
+0 burst fl_auto 110 0
+1650 up lctrl
+200 shot after_flame
+100 quit
